# Everything Soil Server Initial Setup Guide

Connect to server:
```bash
ssh -i /c/Users/mmvrh/scode/lite/llproj.pem ubuntu@3.110.41.198
```

---

### Step 1: Clone Repository in `/data/`

```bash
cd /data
sudo git clone <YOUR_GIT_REPO_URL> everythingsoil
sudo chown -R ubuntu:www-data /data/everythingsoil
cd /data/everythingsoil
```

---

### Step 2: Create Virtual Environment and Install Dependencies

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

### Step 3: Set up Production `.env`

```bash
cp .env.example .env
nano .env
# Fill in real SECRET_KEY, ALLOWED_HOSTS, DATABASE_URL, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, etc.
```

---

### Step 4: Create Database in AWS RDS MySQL (Run Once)

MySQL / AWS RDS does not automatically create new databases. Create the `everythingsoil` database schema in RDS:

```bash
mysql -h llproj.c76yuaqsah3r.ap-south-1.rds.amazonaws.com -P 3306 -u admin -p -e "CREATE DATABASE IF NOT EXISTS everythingsoil CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;"
```

---

### Step 5: Run Initial Migrations & Static Collection

```bash
python manage.py migrate --settings=ets.settings.prod
python manage.py collectstatic --settings=ets.settings.prod --noinput
```

---

### Step 5: Configure systemd Service for uWSGI

```bash
sudo cp /data/everythingsoil/uwsgi-everythingsoil.service /etc/systemd/system/
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl start uwsgi-everythingsoil
sudo systemctl enable uwsgi-everythingsoil
sudo systemctl status uwsgi-everythingsoil
```

---

### Step 6: Configure Nginx Server Block

```bash
sudo cp /data/everythingsoil/everythingsoil.nginx.conf /etc/nginx/sites-available/everythingsoil.com
sudo ln -s /etc/nginx/sites-available/everythingsoil.com /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/
sudo nginx -t
sudo systemctl reload nginx
```

---

### Step 7: Obtain SSL Certificate with Certbot

```bash
sudo certbot --nginx -d everythingsoil.com -d www.everythingsoil.com
```

---

### Step 8: Subsequent Deployments

For future updates, simply execute:
```bash
chmod +x /data/everythingsoil/deploy.sh
sudo /data/everythingsoil/deploy.sh
```
